A Claude Code session transcript (`<session id>.jsonl`) shaped like Claude
Code 2.1.289 writes it: the record keys (parentUuid aside), a model
attachment, a command echo and a meta line (neither the human's words),
prompts with their permissionMode, assistant messages written once per
content block, Bash, Read and Edit calls with their tool_result lines and
toolUseResult objects (one failed, with is_error), a message ainetd typed
into the terminal, and a last tool call still waiting for its result.
Written for ainet; every value is neutral.
